# Pairs with NoWaitCycle. A sibling call left marked done blocks every later split of B from calling C.
MODULE: ForegroundSiblingNotRetired
TARGET: NoWaitCycle
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: the foreground split moves on without retiring its finished sibling call
PERTURBS: ForegroundSiblingDone

--- FIND
    /\ fg = "awaitSib"
    /\ sib = "done"
    /\ sib' = "none"
--- REPLACE
    /\ fg = "awaitSib"
    /\ sib = "done"
    \* MUTATION: the call is not retired
    /\ sib' = "done"
--- END
